# Automatic model experiment scheduling paused (2026-10-14)

Product/architecture issues are prioritized before scientific model reruns.

While this marker exists on `main`, `experiment-conveyor.yml` writes an
explicit `paused: true` result and will not dispatch or retry any automatic
heavyweight CPU/model workflow. This does not cancel already-running jobs,
change normal frontend/backend/security/desktop CI, delete past experiment
artifacts, or prevent explicitly invoked manual research workflows.

**Resume:** remove this marker in a reviewed PR once architecture and feature
code gates are complete. Existing frozen SHA provenance and experiment DAG
logic remain intact; GitHub Actions' hourly reconciliation can then resume.
